 "_about": "Rows pulled from the LMFDB (read-only PostgreSQL mirror, via the lmfdb MCP server) on 2026-09-05 for the five rank-two curves y^2 = x^3 - Dx of Coates--Liang--Sujatha (CLS2, Thm 1.3), D = -14, 17, -33, -34, -39, and the 2-isogenous curve y^2 = x^3 - 56x that the paper uses in place of D = -14.  Tables: ec_curvedata, ec_mwbsd (gens are projective triples), ec_localdata (one row per bad prime; root_number is the LOCAL root number, and the global root number is their product times -1 for the archimedean place), ec_iwasawa (iwdata: 'a' = additive; [lambda, mu] at good ordinary primes; [lambda+, lambda-, mu] at supersingular primes), ec_classdata (aplist = a_p for p < 100), ec_padic (val = valuation of the p-adic regulator of the isogeny class at precision 20, p < 100).  The LMFDB values are quoted in the paper and not recomputed, except where a script records its own recomputation.",
